{"id":"662327","name":"香蕉派","author":"莱拉小厨房","authorId":"10296546","desc":"","cover":"images/662327/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"吐司","amount":"4片"}],"sub":[{"name":"香蕉","amount":"半根"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"备好食材。","img":"images/662327/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香蕉放入碗中，用勺碾成泥，挤入炼乳，拌匀。","img":"images/662327/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"吐司去掉四边，用擀面杖擀薄。","img":"images/662327/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋只取蛋黄，打匀。","img":"images/662327/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"土司片上刷层蛋黄液，放一勺拌好的香蕉泥。","img":"images/662327/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"对半盖住，用叉子将三面开口压实。","img":"images/662327/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"表面刷上蛋黄液。","img":"images/662327/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烤箱预热后，180度15分钟即可，也可用空气炸锅。","img":"images/662327/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}